  "_comment": "Golden vectors for packages/engine/src/plctimer.ts. Each case was worked out by hand from the rules in spec/plc-timer-semantics.md (one scan at a time), not by running the engine. events lists every Boolean output change as [t, signal, to, ET-or-ACC]. checks pins individual scans as [t, field, value].",
